  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.1.0: lookups no longer take a lock; string, numeric and span keys are hashed without allocating for the default Murmur3 strategies; new AddKey/ContainsKey span overloads, GetOccupancy (fill ratio, estimated key count and current false-positive rate) and Union/UnionWith for combining filters built with the same settings. No breaking changes: hashing, key encoding and the persisted format (version 2) are unchanged, and 2.0.x and 2.1.0 read each other's snapshots. Version 2 requires .NET 10; filters persisted by 1.x must be rebuilt from their original keys. See README.md.",
